IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SHADOWKV-KEYS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RANK-K              PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SAVING-PCT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FIDELITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SHADOWKV-KEYS.
    IF DIM-D == 0 OR RANK-K == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE DIM-D TO SAVING-PCT.
    SUBTRACT RANK-K FROM SAVING-PCT.
    MULTIPLY 100 BY SAVING-PCT.
    DIVIDE DIM-D INTO SAVING-PCT.
    MOVE 98 TO FIDELITY-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SAVING-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 FIDELITY-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
